- Entity ID.
- Timestamp.
- Relevant changed fields.
- Request correlation ID if supported.

Important actions:

- Material created.
- Material updated.
- Material deactivated.
- Material activated.
- Service created.
- Service updated.
- Service deactivated.
- Category changes.
- Compatibility changes.
- Material cost updates.
- Coverage updates.

Do not log passwords, tokens, credentials, or unnecessary sensitive information.

Avoid duplicating an existing audit logging mechanism.

