# 28. Definition of Done

Phase 5 is complete when Deck Estimator has a fully functional, secure, Admin-controlled Material and Service Catalog Management system.

Admin must be able to manage material categories, materials, service categories, services, product specifications, coverage information, reference costs, and material-service compatibility through the frontend.

All catalog information must be stored and retrieved through the backend and MongoDB.

The system must be validated through automated tests and live database verification.

The catalog must be ready for Phase 6 to consume without implementing Phase 6 pricing calculations prematurely.

**Final objective: Build a reliable, maintainable catalog foundation for the Deck Estimator pricing engine.**